NC Digital designs custom websites for businesses in Neath — hand-coded, mobile-first sites built to rank on Google and convert visitors into enquiries.

## Web design built for Neath businesses

Neath is a busy market town in Neath Port Talbot, sitting between Swansea and Port Talbot. With a mix of trades, professional services, hospitality, and retail — competition for local customers is real. A professional, conversion-focused website makes a direct difference to the enquiries you receive.

We design from scratch, no templates. Every site is fast, mobile-friendly, and structured for SEO from the first page.

## What's included in every web design project

- Bespoke design based on your brand and goals
- Mobile-first, tested across all screen sizes and browsers
- On-page SEO — titles, meta descriptions, heading structure, schema markup
- Contact forms with spam protection
- Google Analytics and Search Console connected
- SSL certificate and security hardening included

